{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19644","headline":"暮春醉中寄李干秀才 · 马异","name":"暮春醉中寄李干秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欢异且交亲，酒生开瓮春。\n不须愁犯卯，且乞醉过申。\n折草爲筹筯，铺花作锦裀。\n娇莺解言语，留客也殷勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马异","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}